                    </h3>
                  </a>
                </div>
                <div id="collapseThree3" class="collapse" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="headingThree3" data-parent="#accordionEx">
                  <div class="card-body">
                    <p> Today, many business structures in the UAE allow founders to retain full ownership and decision-making authority, providing greater control over operations, strategy, and long-term direction.</p>
